 "description": "Version 5.0 of the Crimson Hexagon / NH-OS DOI Registry, a historical ground-truth inventory of 200 archive documents at the end of January 2026. The registry records each work’s DOI, title, credited authors, document type, and architectural placement, and distinguishes its function from the Fractal Navigation Maps: the maps route traversal, while the registry preserves the enumerated record.\n\nThis version expands the registry from 159 to 200 entries with the Revelation Room, Commission of the Immanent Turning, *Epistle to the Human Diaspora*, Sevenfold Witness, Afterlife Archive, soteriological framework, and navigation-map updates. It is superseded by record #31, version 7.0, but remains the canonical historical snapshot of the v5.0 state.",
